<div class="sp85-center"><div class="sp85-eyebrow">Your Architecture. Your Way.</div><h2 class="sp85-title">Three Paths. One Time Clock Strategy.</h2><p class="sp85-copy">Choose SDK, app or cloud integration based on how much of the experience you want to own.</p></div>
