<div class="sp85-path-row"><div class="sp85-path-name"><small>Maximum Control</small>Platform SDK</div><div class="sp85-path-desc">Build your own Android time-clock application and user experience on the Ultima hardware platform while using ZKTeco WFM for the specialized device foundation.</div><div class="sp85-path-fit"><b>Best fit</b>Software companies that want to own the clock application and UX.</div></div>
<div class="sp85-path-row"><div class="sp85-path-name"><small>Faster Application Path</small>TimeTrack + APIs</div><div class="sp85-path-desc">Use ZKTeco WFM's employee-facing application and integrate the workforce transactions your platform needs, reducing the amount of device-side application development you own.</div><div class="sp85-path-fit"><b>Best fit</b>Partners that want to move faster with a proven clock application.</div></div>
<div class="sp85-path-row"><div class="sp85-path-name"><small>Connected Operations</small>CirrusConnect</div><div class="sp85-path-desc">Use partner cloud middleware for device connectivity, centralized management, monitoring and integration services while keeping your WFM/HCM platform at the center of the customer experience.</div><div class="sp85-path-fit"><b>Best fit</b>Partners that want to reduce device connectivity and fleet-management burden.</div></div>
</div>
